r she thinks  that they're in the passageway between  the worlds that's getting her to open it  and prove her wrong Coraline grabs the  snow globe while her back is turned and  throws the cat and is able to escape  back to her world bringing her mom and  dad with her and freeing the souls of  the children when she gets back home she  appreciates her world for what it is and  we know that she's completed her  character transformation when she falls  asleep on the uncomfortable armchair in  the drawing room her father makes  pineapple pizza for dinner which is kind  of a compromise for her she eats the  pizza but leaves the pineapple  pineapple chunks are the only good part  [Music]  that night she dreamt of a picnic under  an old oak tree where she played with  the children whose souls had been  rescued it was a sweet moment because  she finally has friends to play with in  a way but then she sees a shadow across  their faces and they tell her that  there's more that she has to do the  other mother had sworn by her right hand  to let her go if she won the game so now  the hand was scuttling around the world  like a spider trying to steal back the  key  the next day Coraline visits miss [ __ ]  and miss forceable again and they tell  her almost everything as well but they  do see an ominous hand in her future  Coraline comes up with one final plan to  try to do away with the other mother  once and for all she sneaks back to the  spot that she had initially set out  exploring for when they first moved into  the house the old well making sure that  she's not followed she removed the  planks from the top and sets up a mock  tea party using the tea cups to weigh  down the picnic blanket and hide the  fact that the well was open then she  goes back to the house dangling the key  around her hand for all the see and  loudly says where she'll be playing and  this prompts the hand to go after her  and try to steal back the key she places  it in the center of the picnic blanket